Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:17:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show a brightness popup next to the volume one

Brightness hotkeys (knulli-brightness + 5 / - 5) give no feedback in the
menus, unlike volume.

Add BrightnessInfoComponent: the volume popup (same frame, bar, label and
timing) placed right of it, reading the backlight every 40 ms from
/sys/class/backlight, or from the Allwinner display driver (/dev/disp,
DISP_LCD_GET_BRIGHTNESS) where there is no backlight class, as
/usr/bin/brightness does. It follows the "show overlay when volume
changes" setting.

Only user changes show it. The level found at start is taken silently,
like the volume, and so are changes while knulli-brightness keeps
/var/run/knulli-brightness (battery saver dim or display off, and their
restore), for 1.5 s after it, and after a gap of more than 1 s between
two reads (ES stopped by the battery saver, suspend, a game running).

VolumeInfoComponent gets readLevel(), showChange() and moveToSlot() for
this; the volume popup behaves as before.
